  <h1>Request Account Deletion</h1>

  <p>You can request deletion of your The Match account
  and associated personal information.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Contact The Match support using the link below.</li>
      <li>Send: “I want to request deletion of my The Match
      account and associated personal information.”</li>
      <li>Provide the email address linked to your account
      so support can verify ownership.</li>
      <li>Never send your password, bank PIN, or verification
      code.</li>
    </ol>

    <a class="button"
       href="https://wa.me/message/5LB77KW7QGYSJ1"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Request Account Deletion
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>What happens next?</h2>
  <p>This page submits a deletion request through support.
  It does not delete your account automatically. Support
  must verify and process your request.</p>

  <h2>Information that may be retained</h2>
  <p>Limited information may be retained when required by
  law or necessary for security, fraud prevention, or
  resolving disputes.</p>

  <p>Read our <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
  and <a href="/terms.html">Terms of Service</a>.</p>

  <p>The Match · Adults 18+ only</p>
